    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Jacob Have I Loved by Katherine Paterson tells the story of Louise Bradshaw, a jealous and self-doubting girl growing up in her twin sister's shadow on a Chesapeake Bay island, as she struggles to find her identity, independence, and self-worth.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
