    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Gregor Samsa wakes up one morning transformed into a cockroach, and must navigate the emotional and social struggles he faces as his family reacts to his change and his sense of identity unravels.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
