    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The speaker reflects on a childhood dollhouse as a symbol of memory, control, and the passage of time. Through the image of the miniature home, the poem explores themes of nostalgia, loss, and the contrast between imagined order and real-life unpredictability.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
