    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Set in a dystopian future where climate change has ravaged the world, Indigenous people are hunted for their bone marrow, which is believed to cure the widespread epidemic of memory loss, and a young man  leads a group of Indigenous refugees on a perilous journey to escape the government's oppressive pursuit.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
