    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A collection of interconnected short stories that follows a group of soldiers serving in the Vietnam War, focusing on their experiences, the physical and emotional burdens they carry, and the impact of the war on their lives.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
