    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Liesel steals books and learns to read in Nazi Germany, using the power of words to cope with loss and resist the horrors of war as Death narrates her story.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
