    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The Poet X follows Xiomara Batista as she discovers her voice and identity through poetry and navigates the tensions of family, faith, and self-expression she experiences during her teenage years. </TTEXTS:has_summary>
