    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Eating Poetry humorously captures the rebellious and transformative power of poetry, as the speaker literally consumes poems to escape reality and experience their emotional intensity.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
