    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A Thousand Splendid Suns is at once an incredible chronicle of thirty years of Afghan history and a deeply moving story of family, friendship, faith, and the salvation to be found in love.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
