    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">When a jury of twelve men must decide the fate of a teenage boy accused of murder, one juror stands alone in questioning the evidence. As tensions rise in the jury room, each man confronts his own biases, and the case becomes a test of justice, reason, and integrity.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
