    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">"We Wear the Mask" reveals how Black Americans hide their pain and suffering behind a facade of happiness, exposing the emotional toll of racism and societal oppression.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
