    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Santiago, an aging Cuban fisherman, endures a grueling battle with a giant marlin far out in the Gulf Stream after weeks of bad luck. His physical struggle becomes a quiet, powerful reflection on pride, perseverance, and the dignity found in enduring hardship.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
