    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The Kite Runner tells the story of Amir, a young boy from Kabul, who struggles with guilt and redemption after betraying his childhood friend Hassan, and later returns to Afghanistan to confront his past and seek forgiveness.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
