    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">When imaginative and spirited orphan Anne Shirley is mistakenly sent to live with elderly siblings Marilla and Matthew Cuthbert on Prince Edward Island, her presence turns their quiet lives upside down. As Anne grows up, she learns to navigate friendship, family, and self-discovery, bringing joy and change to the world around her.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
