    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Set during the Trojan War, The Iliad focuses on the wrath of the Greek warrior Achilles after a dispute with Agamemnon, which leads to devastating consequences for both sides. As gods intervene and heroes fall, the epic explores themes of honor, fate, glory, and the brutal cost of war.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
