    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">After hearing about her husband's death, a woman experiences a complex range of emotions, including joy and relief, only to shockingly discover he is alive and dies from the shock.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
