    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">"Nothing Gold Can Stay" by Robert Frost expresses the idea that all things pure, beautiful, and perfect are fleeting and inevitably fade with time.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
