    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">After a nuclear war devastates the United States, Randy Bragg and his small Florida town struggle to survive in isolation, ultimately rebuilding a self-sufficient and resilient community amid the collapse of civilization.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
