    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A graphic novel that chronicles the author's childhood and early adulthood in Iran during and after the Islamic Revolution, and the struggles of growing up in a politically turbulent environment.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
