    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A young squire named Sir Constant is knighted into service of the Great King and embarks on an allegorical quest along the Splendid Waybattling temptations from figures like the Black Knight, the Whisperer, and Master Envyas he journeys through trials toward the City of the Great King.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
