    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">I am Malala is the remarkable tale of a family uprooted by global terrorism, of the fight for girls' education, of a father who, himself a school owner, championed and encouraged his daughter to write and attend school, and of brave parents who have a fierce love for their daughter in a society that prizes sons.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
