    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The novel A Man Called Ove alternates between Oves childhood and his present as a curmudgeonly widower who, after multiple failed suicide attempts, finds renewed purpose through unexpected friendships with his new neighbors, a stray cat, and a changing community that gradually draws him out of his grief.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
