    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Elizabeth Acevedos "Rat Ode" reclaims the rat as a symbol of resilience and dignity, challenging elitist notions of what is worthy of poetry by honoring the overlooked strength in urban survival.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
