    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Fifteen-year-old Kambili grows up in a strict and oppressive household under her devoutly religious father in Nigeria, until a visit to her aunts more liberal home exposes her to new ways of thinking. As political unrest brews outside and family tensions rise within, Kambili begins to find her voice and question the limits of faith, freedom, and love.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
    <TTEXTS:has_year_of_publication rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">2003</TTEXTS:has_year_of_publication>
