    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">We Real Cool succinctly portrays the rebellious lives of young pool players, capturing their defiant attitude and hinting at the fleeting, risky nature of their existence.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
