    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">After destroying a neighbors marigold garden in a moment of frustration, Lizabeth experiences a painful yet transformative realization about the complexity of human emotions, poverty, and the loss of innocence.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
