    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A grieving man is visited by a mysterious raven. As the bird repeatedly utters the word Nevermore, the man descends into despair, haunted by the loss of his lost love, Lenore, and tormented by the hopelessness of never being reunited with her.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
