    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A man asserts his existence to the universe, but the universe responds with indifference, acknowledging his presence without granting him significance. The poem highlights the theme of cosmic indifference and humanity's struggle for meaning.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
