    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The novel portrays the Joad's struggle for dignity and justice amid harsh conditions, as they travel from Oklahoma to California during the Great Depression. </TTEXTS:has_summary>
