    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">"Be the Best of Whatever You Are encourages readers to take pride in who they are and what they do, no matter their role in life. It emphasizes doing one's best with integrity and purpose, regardless of status or position.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
